# Live at the Warfield (Jerry Garcia Band album)

}}
Live at the Warfield is a six-CD live album by the Jerry Garcia Band.  It contains recordings of three complete concerts performed on February 28, March 1, and March 2, 1991, at the Warfield Theatre in San Francisco.  It is scheduled to be released on August 15, 2025.
Each of the three concerts will also be released separately on vinyl – February 28, 1991 (four LPs) on August 15, 2025; March 1, 1991 (four LPs) on October 3, 2025; and March 2, 1991 (five LPs) on December 5, 2025.
